{"actions":[{"actionCode":"H11100","actionDate":"2025-03-03","source":"House floor actions","text":"Referred to the House Committee on the Budget.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"Intro-H","actionDate":"2025-03-03","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"1000","actionDate":"2025-03-03","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"}],"congress":119,"congressGovUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/1771","cosponsors":[{"bioguideId":"P000613","fullName":"Rep. Panetta, Jimmy [D-CA-19]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-03","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"B001301","fullName":"Rep. Bergman, Jack [R-MI-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-03","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MI"},{"bioguideId":"P000608","fullName":"Rep. Peters, Scott H. [D-CA-50]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-03","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"T000481","fullName":"Rep. Tlaib, Rashida [D-MI-12]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-10","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MI"},{"bioguideId":"F000466","fullName":"Rep. Fitzpatrick, Brian K. [R-PA-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-24","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"PA"},{"bioguideId":"V000138","fullName":"Rep. Vindman, Eugene Simon [D-VA-7]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-10-03","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"VA"},{"bioguideId":"M001204","fullName":"Rep. Meuser, Daniel [R-PA-9]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-08-10","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"PA"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T20:09:44+00:00","id":"hr1771-119","introducedDate":"2025-03-03","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-03-03","text":"Referred to the House Committee on the Budget."},"laws":[],"number":"1771","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Economics and Public Finance","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"Y000067","district":2,"fullName":"Rep. Yakym, Rudy [R-IN-2]","party":"R","state":"IN"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-03-03","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Improper Payments Transparency Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the President's annual budget to include specified information regarding improper payment amounts and rates for programs and activities at certain federal agencies. (An <em>improper payment</em>&nbsp;is any payment that should not have been made or that was made in an incorrect amount, including an overpayment or underpayment, under a statutory, contractual, administrative, or other legally applicable requirement.)</p><p>Specifically, the President's budget must include (1) a narrative description, including a detailed explanation of why any improper payment amounts and&nbsp;rates occurred and related trends for programs and activities; and (2) corrective actions and steps the agencies will take to address improper payment amount and rate issues.&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2025-05-06T16:15:05Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Improper Payments Transparency Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-08T19:31:27Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-08T19:31:27Z"}
